    <title>VOL.14 聊聊你身边经历过的灵异事件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67eb96d50decaeb09433edd1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67eb96d50decaeb09433edd1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Apr 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>深夜照镜突然看见陌生面孔！ </span><br><span>电梯里的只有我一个人，但突然听到有人给我说话？？！ </span><br><span>祖先托梦竟是阴间「跨境转账」提示？ </span><br><span>很多人都会经历的鬼压床事件 </span><br><span>................................................................</span><br><span>本期的事件都来源于听友们的真实经历投稿，如果你也有类似的经历，也欢迎在评论区留下你的故事～</span></p><span></span><p><span>串台</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65b4e79b0e2ba8ca33acf433" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65b4e79b0e2ba8ca33acf433"><span>《非常突然》</span></a><span>-传送门：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ea9e290decaeb094098526" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ea9e290decaeb094098526"><span>《开工不敬神？工地血案背后的风水禁忌及捉妖全过程》</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>🌍 </span><em><strong><span>宝藏插播</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>联系小助手（vx：_Pangsi_）领取「太岁手机壁纸」。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【合作、咨询】👇</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5DUrFsKP3WgEFvIhmHkLkx3ESt.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>⏰</span><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">00:01:08</a> 清明节灵异事件征集 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">00:02:36</a> 道教兵马怎么用？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">00:05:15</a> 风水一般怎么接活？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">00:07:06</a> 民间命理「克夫」现象解读 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">00:08:39</a> 电梯灵异事件</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="797">00:13:17</a> 十字路口烧纸有什么规矩？ </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">00:14:17</a> 镜深夜照镜看见陌生面孔？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1011">00:16:51</a> 鬼压床系列 </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">00:22:51</a> 弥留之际的心灵感应</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1506">00:25:06</a> 灵异绝缘体是一件好事情！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>🎙️</span><em><strong><span>节目主播</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>老张：命理师｜擅长八字、风水、奇门，服务客户涵盖金融、科技、文娱等头部企业</span></p><span></span><p><span>圆大梨苗：策划公司创始人、新锐插画师</span></p><span></span><p><span>梨子：资深互联网人</span></p><span></span><p><span>👇</span><em><strong><span>本期串台节目、主播介绍</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjTOrJF0_1KrTEuUEBbHB88VHeKW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>童花顺，毫无学术贡献的历史系毕业生，八年出版界行走的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>摸鱼王（藏在节目背后的男人，因害怕本期内容所以跑去摸鱼啦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>「 💬 联系非常突然」合作、串台、商务请发邮件：1206742598@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
