  <item>
    <title>VOL.13 清明特辑《开工不敬神？工地血案背后的风水禁忌及捉妖全过程》—串台《非常突然》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ea9e290decaeb094098526</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ea9e290decaeb094098526</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Apr 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新工地发生血案，卫星罗盘勘测出“阴阳之门”磁场异象，山石化形精怪，靠吞噬香火化妖作祟。伏乩问事、雷法诛邪，收编精怪、敕封山神，逆转风水局.....本期串台特辑，听我们讲诉老张团队真实版「捉妖记」，带你见证精怪收编入编的全过程（没想到吧，不论哪界都躲不过考编之路😂）～</span></p><span></span><p><span>..................................................................................................</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是《玄龙门镇》第一个串台节目，我们联手播客《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65b4e79b0e2ba8ca33acf433" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65b4e79b0e2ba8ca33acf433"><span>非常突然</span></a><span>》一起为各位奉上清明灵异故事特辑，欢迎订阅收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>清明专题-传送门：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c9b2aae924d4525ac6ced9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c9b2aae924d4525ac6ced9"><span>祭祖有方，运势开光｜聊聊清明宜忌</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>🌍 </span><em><strong><span>宝藏插播</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>联系小助手（vx：_Pangsi_）领取「太岁手机壁纸」。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>报名「</span><em><strong><span>包袱代烧</span></strong></em><span>」（截止时间：2024年4月3日）。通过仪式传递思念，跨越阴阳界限送达心意。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【合作、咨询】👇</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5DUrFsKP3WgEFvIhmHkLkx3ESt.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>⏰ </span><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">00:01:07</a> 串台机缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">00:03:42</a> 山间捉妖行动前情铺垫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">00:06:09</a> 玄学工作室团队配置介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">00:12:50</a> 关于驱邪、抓鬼、捉妖、请神的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">00:14:50</a> 请神三要素：牌位、香火与「工作证」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">00:17:01</a> 阴间兵马收编指南：鬼魂再就业计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">00:20:33</a> 土地神沟通指南：工程建设前的必修课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1524">00:25:24</a> 反宫煞风水事件：大门位置的致命错误</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1709">00:28:29</a> 罗盘显灵事件：山石人脸浮现之谜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lneOmUKKJAeI-UbXvMfk2-lBzeVf.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgwEQZ-d8KGHiqs6A6Uopal8-Yt0.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1757">00:29:17</a> 凶煞风水判定：反弓煞、龙虎局、拖尸房、一龙骨枯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoS0VlKOdpyNWi-30gBuaZJFviQ2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsu6D9zXs19e6IA-f_2OrMIv0CrK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh0klD0I5gr0u1YMCuVGOaSk99YV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs17gSkuafcHJea9UEIBxj0_PsY6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">00:40:16</a> 伏乩问事：在玄学上如何通过“伏乩”进行通灵问事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2754">00:45:54</a> 移动神坛：画像替代神像的祭祀（移动办公）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3081">00:51:21</a> 请神风险提示：精怪冒充神明的识别指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3307">00:55:07</a> 山石成精法则：香火滋养与五官进化论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3589">00:59:49</a> 真实版捉妖工作过程：打斗-谈判-收编</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3709">01:01:49</a> 捉妖仪式物资清单：从贡品到契约文书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmfUmkEBC-k-YU9kAwkgpj0x61Tj.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4546">01:15:46</a> 祸从口出，不敬神明的真实案例</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️ </span><em><strong><span>节目主播</span></strong></em><span> </span><br><span>老张：命理师｜擅长八字、风水、奇门，服务客户涵盖金融、科技、文娱等头部企业</span><br><span>圆大梨苗：策划公司创始人、新锐插画师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>👇</span><em><strong><span>本期串台节目、主播介绍</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjTOrJF0_1KrTEuUEBbHB88VHeKW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>串台主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>童花顺，毫无学术贡献的历史系毕业生，八年出版界行走的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>摸鱼王（藏在节目背后的男人，因害怕本期内容所以跑去摸鱼啦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>「 💬 联系非常突然」合作、串台、商务请发邮件：1206742598@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
