  <item>
    <title>VOL.12 祭祖有方，运势开光｜聊聊清明宜忌</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c9b2aae924d4525ac6ced9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c9b2aae924d4525ac6ced9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Mar 2025 14:40:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>清明将至，我们该如何与祖先建立联结？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们烧的东西，他们真的可以收到吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>祭祖先能否真的保佑我们？</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲人托梦是在预示什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>............................................................</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫墓不仅是孝道传承，更是通过特定仪轨实现阴阳两界的能量交互，本期节目，我们一起聊聊清明节祭祖仪式和民俗文化～</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>🌍宝藏插播</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>联系小助手（vx：_Pangsi_）领取「</span><strong><span>太岁手机壁纸</span></strong><span>」。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>报名「</span><strong><span>包袱代烧</span></strong><span>」（截止时间：2025年4月3日）。通过节日的仪式，将承载着爱与思念的礼物，寄送到想见的人身边。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>【合作、咨询】👇</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fusc2ohkcHLaFNeicNGE59vgYb9G.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>⏰</span><em><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:00:58</a> 福利：安太岁壁纸领取中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">00:01:30</a> 清明节的历史渊源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">00:05:27</a> 除怀念祖先外，祭祀也会影响家族气运</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">00:07:42</a> 阴间生存指南：祖先也要「花钱」过日子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">00:09:36</a> 如果没有祭祀祖先，会被责怪吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">00:10:43</a> 阴间生存指南：祖先也要「花钱」过日子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">00:12:41</a> 聊聊正确的烧纸流程、异地代烧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">00:15:02</a> 烧包袱后的几周，我被托梦了.....</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">00:19:28</a> 扫墓注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">00:20:21</a> 辟邪小技巧：柚子叶沐浴+雷神壁纸防护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">00:24:31</a> 祭祖注意事项：为什么说有的家族容易发达？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">00:27:39</a> 宠物身后事指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1979">00:32:59</a> 什么是还阴债？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">00:35:01</a> 地府也有自己的金融体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2446">00:40:46</a> 烧纸质量决定祖先庇佑力度</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>老张：命理师｜擅长八字、风水、奇门，服务客户涵盖金融、科技、文娱等头部企业</span></p><span></span><p><span>圆大梨苗：策划公司创始人、新锐插画师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>梨子：资深互联网人</span></p>]]></description>
